# Search ignore file for ripgrep and the tools built on it (agents' code search).
# It does not affect git: these folders stay tracked and published.
#
# docs/ (generated API references, one full copy per release) and dist/ (built binaries per
# release) are about 93% of the tracked files, so a repository-wide search mostly hits copies
# of generated output. To look inside them, name the path explicitly (read the file, `ls`,
# `find`) or run `rg --no-ignore`.
/docs/
/dist/
